Spec: sensitivity is P(reject | defective). Computing it over the acceptable cases instead
silently reports the wrong error rate -- the exact conflation the two-number design forbids.
@@@
        ratio(
            self.rejected_defective,
            self.rejected_defective
                .saturating_add(self.missed_defective),
        )
--->
        ratio(
            self.approved_acceptable,
            self.approved_acceptable
                .saturating_add(self.rejected_acceptable),
        )
